<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Mikayrie Dulay — CWTS 2 Portfolio</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;0,900;1,400;1,700&family=DM+Sans:opsz,wght@9..40,300;9..40,400;9..40,500;9..40,600&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <style>
    :root {
      --green-deep:   #1a3a2a;
      --green-mid:    #2d5a40;
      --green-light:  #4a7c59;
      --green-muted:  #6b9e7a;
      --gold:         #c9a84c;
      --gold-light:   #e4c870;
      --cream:        #f5f0e8;
      --cream-dark:   #ede7d9;
      --white:        #ffffff;
      --text-dark:    #1a1a1a;
      --text-mid:     #3d3d3d;
      --text-muted:   #7a7a6e;
      --card-bg:      #ffffff;
      --shadow-sm:    0 2px 12px rgba(26,58,42,0.08);
      --shadow-md:    0 8px 32px rgba(26,58,42,0.14);
      --shadow-lg:    0 20px 60px rgba(26,58,42,0.20);
      --radius-sm:    6px;
      --radius-md:    14px;
      --radius-lg:    22px;
      --font-display: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
      --font-body:    'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      --font-mono:    'DM Mono', monospace;
      --transition:   all 0.38s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      background-color: var(--cream);
      color: var(--text-dark);
      line-height: 1.75;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    img { max-width: 100%; display: block; object-fit: cover; }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

    .container { width: 90%; max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; }

    .section-label {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    }

    .reveal {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(28px);
      transition: opacity 0.72s ease, transform 0.72s ease;
    }
    .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    .reveal-delay-1 { transition-delay: 0.10s; }
    .reveal-delay-2 { transition-delay: 0.20s; }
    .reveal-delay-3 { transition-delay: 0.32s; }
    .reveal-delay-4 { transition-delay: 0.44s; }
    .reveal-delay-5 { transition-delay: 0.56s; }

    /* NAV */
    nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      z-index: 200; padding: 1.3rem 0;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }
    nav.scrolled {
      background: rgba(26,58,42,0.97);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      padding: 0.85rem 0;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.28);
    }
    .nav-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
    .nav-logo {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--cream); letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }
    .nav-logo span { color: var(--gold); }
    nav ul { display: flex; gap: 1.8rem; list-style: none; }
    nav ul a {
      font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 500;
      color: rgba(245,240,232,0.72);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em; transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    nav ul a:hover { color: var(--gold); }

    /* WAVES */
    .wave { display: block; width: 100%; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0; }
    .wave svg { display: block; width: 100%; }

    /* SECTION 1: ABOUT / HERO */
    #about {
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: var(--green-deep);
      position: relative;
      display: flex; align-items: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 9rem 0 6rem;
    }
    #about::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 512 512' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.68' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='0.05'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
      opacity: 0.35; z-index: 1; pointer-events: none;
    }
    .hero-orb { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; pointer-events: none; }
    .orb1 {
      width: 700px; height: 700px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(74,124,89,0.22) 0%, transparent 68%);
      top: -200px; right: -200px;
    }
    .orb2 {
      width: 420px; height: 420px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(201,168,76,0.10) 0%, transparent 70%);
      bottom: -100px; left: -120px;
    }
    .hero-layout {
      position: relative; z-index: 2;
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 5rem; align-items: center;
    }
    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.55rem;
      background: rgba(201,168,76,0.13);
      border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.28);
      border-radius: 100px;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
    }
    .eyebrow .dot {
      width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--gold);
      animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .eyebrow span {
      font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold-light);
    }
    @keyframes pulse {
      0%,100% { opacity:1; transform:scale(1); }
      50% { opacity:0.45; transform:scale(0.78); }
    }
    .hero-name {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6.5vw, 5.5rem);
      font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.05;
      color: var(--cream); margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .hero-name em { font-style: italic; color: var(--gold); }
    .hero-tagline {
      font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.62);
      max-width: 420px; margin-bottom: 2.4rem; line-height: 1.8;
    }
    .hero-chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.65rem; }
    .chip {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
      border-radius: 100px; padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.65);
    }
    .cwts-intro-card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.22);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 2.8rem 2.4rem;
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }
    .cwts-intro-card h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--cream); margin-bottom: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.25;
    }
    .cwts-intro-card h3 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--gold); }
    .cwts-intro-card p {
      font-size: 0.9rem; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.65);
      line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .cwts-intro-card p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .gold-rule {
      width: 48px; height: 2px; background: var(--gold);
      margin-bottom: 1.4rem; border-radius: 2px;
    }
    .hero-scroll {
      position: absolute; bottom: 2.2rem; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
      z-index: 3; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .hero-scroll span {
      font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.62rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(245,240,232,0.4);
    }
    .scroll-line {
      width: 1px; height: 38px;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(201,168,76,0.55), transparent);
      animation: scrollDown 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes scrollDown {
      0%   { transform: scaleY(0); transform-origin: top; opacity: 1; }
      50%  { transform: scaleY(1); transform-origin: top; opacity: 1; }
      100% { transform: scaleY(1); transform-origin: bottom; opacity: 0; }
    }

    /* SECTION 2: EXPERIENCE */
    #experience { background: var(--cream); padding: 7rem 0 5rem; }
    .section-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4.5rem; }
    .section-header h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem);
      font-weight: 900; color: var(--green-deep); margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }
    .section-header h2 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--green-mid); }
    .section-header p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; }

    .split-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 5rem;
    }
    .split-panel {
      background: var(--card-bg); border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 2.6rem 2.2rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      border-top: 3px solid var(--gold);
    }
    .split-panel h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 700; color: var(--green-deep); margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }
    .values-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.85rem; }
    .values-list li {
      display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-mid); line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .values-list li .ico { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 0.05rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .values-list li strong { color: var(--green-deep); font-weight: 600; }
    .exp-items { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.1rem; }
    .exp-item {
      display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start;
      padding-bottom: 1.1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cream-dark);
    }
    .exp-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; padding-bottom: 0; }
    .exp-num {
      font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--gold); background: var(--green-deep);
      padding: 0.3rem 0.55rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 0.15rem;
    }
    .exp-item-text strong {
      font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--green-deep);
      font-weight: 600; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
    }
    .exp-item-text span { font-size: 0.83rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

    /* Gallery */
    .gallery-label { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
    .gallery-label h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 700; color: var(--green-deep);
    }
    .gallery-label p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 0.4rem; }
    .photo-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    }
    .photo-grid.four-col { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
    .photo-grid.layout-tall .grid-item:first-child { grid-row: span 2; }
    .grid-item {
      position: relative; border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #cde0d3 0%, #b8cebd 100%);
      cursor: pointer; min-height: 220px;
    }
    .grid-item.tall { min-height: 460px; }
    .grid-item img {
      width: 100%; height: 100%; min-height: inherit;
      object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
    }
    .ph {
      width: 100%; height: 100%; min-height: inherit;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.4rem;
      transition: transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
    }
    .grid-item:hover img,
    .grid-item:hover .ph { transform: scale(1.07); }
    .ph-icon { font-size: 2rem; opacity: 0.38; }
    .ph-label {
      font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--green-mid); opacity: 0.55;
    }
    .photo-overlay {
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(26,58,42,0.65) 0%, transparent 55%);
      opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.38s;
      display: flex; align-items: flex-end; padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    }
    .grid-item:hover .photo-overlay { opacity: 1; }
    .photo-overlay span {
      font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold-light);
    }

    /* SECTION 3: REFLECTIONS */
    #reflections {
      background: var(--green-deep);
      padding: 8rem 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    #reflections::before {
      content: '"';
      position: absolute; top: -2rem; left: -2rem;
      font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 30rem;
      font-weight: 900; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.025);
      line-height: 1; pointer-events: none; user-select: none;
    }
    .reflections-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .reflections-inner .section-header h2 { color: var(--cream); }
    .reflections-inner .section-header h2 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--gold); }
    .reflections-inner .section-header p { color: rgba(245,240,232,0.5); }
    .day-cards { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.8rem; margin-top: 3.5rem; }
    .day-card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.18);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 2.2rem 2.4rem;
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
      transition: border-color 0.3s;
    }
    .day-card:hover { border-color: rgba(201,168,76,0.38); }
    .day-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0;
      width: 3px; height: 100%;
      background: var(--gold); border-radius: 3px 0 0 3px;
    }
    .day-card-header {
      display: flex; align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }
    .day-badge {
      font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold); background: rgba(201,168,76,0.14);
      border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.28);
      padding: 0.28rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 100px; white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .day-card-header h4 {
      font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700; color: var(--cream);
    }
    .day-card blockquote {
      font-family: var(--font-display); font-style: italic;
      font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--gold-light);
      opacity: 0.85; margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .day-card p {
      font-size: 0.9rem; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.68); line-height: 1.9;
    }

    /* SECTION 4: CONCLUSION */
    #conclusion { background: var(--cream); padding: 7rem 0 0; }
    .qa-wrapper { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .qa-item {
      margin-bottom: 3rem; padding-bottom: 3rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cream-dark);
    }
    .qa-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; margin-bottom: 0; }
    .qa-q { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
    .q-mark {
      font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 900; color: var(--gold); line-height: 1;
      flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: -0.1rem;
    }
    .qa-q h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 700; color: var(--green-deep); line-height: 1.35;
    }
    .qa-a { padding-left: 2.8rem; }
    .qa-a p {
      font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-mid);
      line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    }
    .qa-a p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    .conclusion-block {
      background: var(--green-deep); border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 4rem 3rem; margin: 5rem 0 0;
      position: relative; overflow: hidden; text-align: center;
    }
    .conclusion-block::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; top: -120px; right: -120px;
      width: 380px; height: 380px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(74,124,89,0.3), transparent 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .conclusion-block h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--cream); margin-bottom: 1.4rem; position: relative; z-index: 1;
    }
    .conclusion-block h3 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--gold); }
    .conclusion-block p {
      font-size: 0.97rem; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.68);
      line-height: 1.9; max-width: 620px;
      margin: 0 auto 1.2rem; position: relative; z-index: 1;
    }
    .conclusion-block p:last-of-type { margin-bottom: 0; }

    .thankyou-banner {
      background: var(--gold); padding: 5.5rem 0;
      text-align: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
      margin-top: 5rem;
    }
    .thankyou-banner::before {
      content: 'THANK YOU';
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(6rem, 18vw, 16rem); font-weight: 900;
      color: rgba(26,58,42,0.07);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em; pointer-events: none; user-select: none;
    }
    .thankyou-banner h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 9vw, 8rem); font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--green-deep); line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em; position: relative; z-index: 1;
    }
    .thankyou-banner p {
      font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(26,58,42,0.6);
      margin-top: 1rem; position: relative; z-index: 1;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em; font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* FOOTER */
    footer { background: #0f1f16; padding: 2.4rem 0; }
    .footer-inner {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem;
    }
    .footer-left {
      font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-style: italic; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.38);
    }
    .footer-left span { color: var(--gold); font-style: normal; }
    .footer-center {
      font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(245,240,232,0.25); text-align: center;
    }
    .footer-right {
      font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: rgba(201,168,76,0.42);
    }

    /* RESPONSIVE */
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .photo-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .photo-grid.four-col { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      nav ul { display: none; }
      .hero-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; }
      .split-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .photo-grid.layout-tall .grid-item:first-child { grid-row: span 1; }
      .grid-item.tall { min-height: 220px; }
      .conclusion-block { padding: 2.8rem 1.8rem; }
      .footer-inner { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .photo-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .qa-a { padding-left: 1.5rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- NAV -->
  <nav id="mainNav">
    <div class="container nav-inner">
      <a href="#about" class="nav-logo">CWTS 2<span>.</span></a>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#experience">Experience</a></li>
        <li><a href="#reflections">Reflections</a></li>
        <li><a href="#conclusion">Conclusion</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- ==========================================
       SECTION 1 — ABOUT ME & INTRODUCTION
  =========================================== -->
  <section id="about">
    <div class="hero-orb orb1"></div>
    <div class="hero-orb orb2"></div>

    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-layout">

        <!-- Identity -->
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow reveal">
            <div class="dot"></div>
            <span>CWTS 2 Portfolio · A.Y. 2025–2026</span>
          </div>

          <h1 class="hero-name reveal reveal-delay-1">
            Mikayrie<br/><em>Dulay</em>
          </h1>

          <p class="hero-tagline reveal reveal-delay-2">
            First-year BS Information Technology student at Northern Luzon Adventist College (NLAC) — believing that technology and service are two sides of the same calling, both existing to uplift the lives of others.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-chips reveal reveal-delay-3">
            <span class="chip">BSIT · Year 1</span>
            <span class="chip">NLAC</span>
            <span class="chip">120 Hrs Rendered</span>
            <span class="chip">NSTP · RA 9163</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CWTS Intro Card -->
        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="cwts-intro-card">
            <span class="section-label">CWTS Introduction</span>
            <div class="gold-rule"></div>
            <h3>Community Service is the <em>Bridge</em> Between Empathy and Action</h3>
            <p>
              The Civic Welfare Training Service (CWTS) is the institutional expression of a deeper truth: that education is incomplete without service. Under Republic Act 9163, CWTS 2 requires students to render 120 hours of community service — not as a burden, but as a formation experience.
            </p>
            <p>
